<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>呆病 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%91%86%E7%97%85/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 11:47:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%91%86%E7%97%85/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>呆病</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-14-daibing/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 11:44:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-14-daibing/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“呆病”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论呆病的辨治法则，详细描述了呆病的奇特症状、病机、方药及特殊给药与心理疗法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;呆病如痴，虽似祟凭，实因痰气弥漫胸腹，蒙蔽心神。治呆无奇法，治痰即治呆。然大补心脾、重用消痰之品，佐以镇心安神，并配合巧妙的情志诱导与行为干预，方能奏功&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>生治法：论发狂 论呆病 论花癫 论羊癫</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-13-shengzhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 11:35:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-13-shengzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“生治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;发狂、呆病、花癫、羊癫&lt;/strong&gt;等神志失常重症的救治法则。核心是“人未死而若死，用药以生之”，针对火热痰郁或气虚寒凝的不同病机，以大剂清火、开郁、补正、祛痰之品灌服，使患者从昏乱中苏醒复常。</description></item></channel></rss>